            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Robert Noyce</strong><br>\nRobert Noyce, known as the \"Mayor of Silicon Valley,\" was born on December 12, 1927, in Burlington, Iowa. He was passionate about mathematics and science from a young age. Noyce's father was a congregational minister, and his mother was a schoolteacher, which contributed to his intellectual upbringing. After building a radio from scratch at the age of 12, his interest in electronics burgeoned, leading him to pursue a degree in physics.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Inspiration</strong><br>\nNoyce completed his undergraduate degree at Grinnell College, where he was first exposed to the field of semiconductors. His physics professor granted him access to a cutting-edge lab, where he learned to build and understand scientific equipment. He later earned a Ph.D. in physics from MIT, solidifying his expertise in electronics and physics, which would pave the way for his future innovations.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Semiconductor and Fairchild</strong><br>\nAfter his studies, Noyce co-founded Fairchild Semiconductor in 1957, which became a pioneer in transistor and integrated circuit manufacturing. At Fairchild, Noyce's work on semiconductors led to the development of the silicon integrated circuit, a breakthrough that would revolutionize the electronics industry. His patent for a practical method to connect the components on a silicon chip was a cornerstone of modern electronics.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
